# Path exclusions for markdownlint-cli.
#
# This file is the canonical exclusion mechanism for markdownlint-cli: the rule
# configuration in .markdownlint.json has no "ignores" key, so paths are scoped
# here and rules are scoped there. Both .github/workflows/ci.yml and
# scripts/verify.sh pick this file up automatically — one source of truth.
#
# Syntax is gitignore-style.

# Persisted arc42 architecture output. These documents are produced and
# maintained by the architecture workflow, which owns their formatting; they
# are not hand-authored against this repository's markdownlint rule selection.
docs/

# Yggdrasil Workspace — transient, task-scoped scratch files. Already ignored
# by git (.gitignore), so CI never sees these paths at all; excluding them here
# makes a local lint run match what CI actually checks. The same exclusion is
# configured for yamllint in .yamllint.
.yggdrasil-workspace/

# Dependency tree, never part of the linted corpus. CI additionally passes
# --ignore node_modules on the command line; this entry makes the exclusion
# hold for any invocation, including local ones that omit the flag.
node_modules/
